1
00:00:01,359 --> 00:00:08,209
Spare Room: see what code from a recruiter or client could reach on your Windows laptop.

2
00:00:08,209 --> 00:00:15,030
Everything here is replayed from the real tool, recorded on a test machine. All secrets are fake.

3
00:00:15,947 --> 00:00:23,604
The same probe checked the same 13 fake secrets: 13 were reachable from the normal account.

4
00:00:23,604 --> 00:00:31,266
From the separate interview account, 0 were reachable. Creating that account took 29.6 seconds.

5
00:00:32,189 --> 00:00:40,706
The scan lists what code running as you could reach, by category and severity. It never reads a secret value.

6
00:00:42,101 --> 00:00:48,073
Results: each fake secret, checked once from each account.

7
00:00:54,148 --> 00:01:00,965
Reachable from the normal account. Blocked by Windows from the interview account.

8
00:01:01,885 --> 00:01:10,397
verify, run inside the interview account: all 12 known secret locations in the normal account were denied.

9
00:01:10,397 --> 00:01:18,908
It also found one .env that every account on the PC can read. A separate account cannot protect that file.

10
00:01:19,814 --> 00:01:25,773
Measured on Windows 11 Home. The first sign-in was not timed.

11
00:01:26,681 --> 00:01:34,340
25 of 36 targets named in public attacker reports are covered. Each one links to its source.

12
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:48,328
Every finding gives the path, why it matters, and how to fix it.

13
00:01:49,608 --> 00:01:56,417
Privacy: exactly what the scan reads, and what it never does.

14
00:01:57,326 --> 00:02:04,981
No secret values printed, saved or sent. No network. Both are checked by automated tests.

15
00:02:05,893 --> 00:02:13,563
Only setup and remove-account need administrator rights. You type the password yourself.

16
00:02:14,816 --> 00:02:21,629
Download: one Windows exe. It is unsigned, so check its SHA-256 first.

17
00:02:22,534 --> 00:02:30,198
Start with demo mode: no admin rights, and it touches only the fake laptop bundled inside.

18
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:39,999
Limits: a separate account is weaker than a virtual machine. Admin malware and files every user can read are still exposed.

19
00:02:39,999 --> 00:02:45,109
Spare Room. Built during SafeSpace Hacks 2026, with Claude Code.
